<title>JAPAN: Japan PM says surplus won't expand greatly--Jiji.</title>
<headline>Japan PM says surplus won't expand greatly--Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's trade surplus may grow temporarily but it is unlikely to expand greatly, Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto told business leaders on Thursday, Jiji news agency reported.</p>
</text>
